src/: the Java API classes (sherpa-onnx/java-api) for the offline recognizer and the voice
activity detector, unchanged except LibraryLoader.java, which loads the library with
System.loadLibrary. android/build.sh adds the matching JNI library
(sherpa-onnx-v2.0.1-android-static-link-onnxruntime.tar.bz2, onnxruntime linked in, MIT) and
Silero VAD's model (silero_vad.onnx, MIT, https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad), both
checked against pinned SHA-256 sums.
